\b PrintSave\b0\line
\line
PrintSave saves a copy of every document you print on this PC, converts it to PDF, and files it under C:\\PrintSave by year, month and day, with a searchable index.\line
\line
It installs a background Windows service (which does the capturing) plus a tray app and a command-line tool. Uninstalling removes all three and stops the service; your saved PDFs are left in place.\line
\line
This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. You may use it on your own computer. Third-party components are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.\line
